{"uuid":null,"parentUuid":null,"vendorSessionId":"harness","kind":"assistant","ts":1795000312000,"text":"```ts session/core/idle-core.ts\nexport function idleDecision(snapshot: IdleSnapshot): 'stop' | 'keep' {\n  if (snapshot.isPinned) return 'keep';\n  return snapshot.idleMinutes >= 30 ? 'stop' : 'keep';\n}\n```\n\nIt reads only the snapshot."}
